<title id="map-t">Map of Greenvale</title>
<desc id="map-d">An old-style map. In the south lies the village of Vincent's Hollow. A road runs north through the Eldergreen Wood to Oakenfell, a walled city on the River Mere. Forest and hills continue beyond the edges of the map and fade into unknown country.</desc>
